>
  <p>Oshawa has some of the oldest housing in our service area, and some of the newest. The streets near the lake and downtown have driveways, porches and steps that have served for generations, while the north end and the communities along Winchester and Harmony keep adding homes that need flatwork for the first time. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> works across the whole city, and we back each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>Older Oshawa homes often need the full frontage at once: driveway, steps and porch, sometimes with the foundation coating going too. Because our crew handles all of it, you get one quote, one schedule and one cleanup instead of coordinating three contractors.</p>

  <h2>Oshawa concrete services, listed out</h2>
  <p>The Oshawa work tends to break down like this:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, replacements and new pours</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porches</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a>, repaired or rebuilt</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">Walkways</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-sidewalks/">sidewalks</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-foundations/">Foundations</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">slabs</a>, residential and commercial</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-replacement/">Replacement</a>, <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a> and <a href="/services/parging/">parging</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Commercial concrete too</h2>
  <p>Oshawa businesses call us for parking spaces, sidewalks and other concrete structures. Commercial jobs get the same written quote, the same schedule discipline and the same 2-year warranty as our residential work.</p>

  <h2>Why Oshawa owners hand us the whole frontage</h2>
  <p>Fifteen years of concrete across the GTA, one crew for every trade on the house front, and a written quote before anything is booked. We keep the schedule and the standard, residential and commercial alike.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>2-year warranty on residential and commercial</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed on every finish</li>
    <li>Free quotes, in writing, no pressure</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Photos and a short description through the form gets the ball rolling; every job follows our clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a>. Next door in <a href="/locations/whitby/">Whitby</a> or <a href="/locations/ajax/">Ajax</a>? One call covers family and rental properties in both.</p>
